            "question": "Reevë a good electrolyte powder for a keto diet?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Keto flu is largely an electrolyte problem, sodium and magnesium losses spike as carbohydrate intake drops. A clean electrolyte powder with monk fruit and zero sugar fits keto, paleo, and low-carb eating patterns without adding carbs or artificial sweeteners.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
        },
