            "question": "Does Reevë break an intermittent fast?",
            "answer": "<p>At 8 calories per serving with zero sugar, Reevë is generally considered fast-friendly by most intermittent fasting protocols. That said, definitions of a fast vary, so check your own protocol's rules if you are being strict about it.</p>",
